From e768f93b3bd204d97615a344e7d69454933298f9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Zortos <zortosdev@proton.me>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 20:12:39 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 46/47] frame gen: call the built-in frame generation "Lichii
 Optical Flow", not FSR 3 (#1633)

* frame gen: call the built-in frame generation "Lichii Optical Flow", not FSR 3

* tools/nx2: point the frame generation shader harness at the renamed files

